  "gotIt": "Got it",
  "spatialHelpBody": "1. Move the phone slowly, aiming at the floor, until the app picks up the surface.\n2. Put the crosshair at the foot of a corner and mark it.\n3. Walk to the next corner and mark again: the wall is made with its measurement. You can walk about, the plan stays put.\n4. When you come back to the first corner the line snaps to it: that closes the room.\n\nClosing it asks for a name and the room is created with its walls. The ceiling height is measured afterwards, from the room itself. Here the phone measures the distance, it is not estimated. Even so, check the walls on the plan before buying material.",
